  "description": "<p data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"764\">Ga op een groots ruimte-avontuur in <strong data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"293\">Starlink: Battle for Atlas</strong>, een <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"330\">open-world space-actiongame</strong> waarin je met je eigen modulaire ruimteschip de Atlas-sterrenstelsel verkent. Vlieg vrij door de ruimte, land naadloos op planeten, vecht tegen vijandige facties en breid jouw schip uit met nieuwe vleugels, wapens en modules.<br data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"559\">De Nintendo Switch-versie bevat exclusieve Star Fox-content, waardoor fans extra missies en personages kunnen ontdekken. Het spel verkeert <strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"716\">In Nette Staat</strong> en wordt geleverd met het <strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"763\">originele hoesje</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"787\">🎮 Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<li data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"847\">🚀 <strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"824\">Open-world ruimte-actiegame</strong> met vrije verkenning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"911\">🛠️ Modulair schip: wissel wapens en onderdelen in realtime</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"963\">🌍 Verken unieke planeten met eigen ecosystemen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1021\">🐺 Exclusieve <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1000\">Star Fox-content</strong> op Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1059\">📦 Inclusief <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1057\">origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1085\">📋 Specificaties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1368\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1099\">Platform:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1119\">Nintendo Switch</strong><br data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1122\"><strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1132\">Titel:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1163\">Starlink: Battle for Atlas</strong><br data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1166\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1176\">Genre:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1207\">Ruimte-actie / Open wereld</strong><br data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1210\"><strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1219\">Taal:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1247\">Meertalig (o.a. Engels)</strong><br data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1250\"><strong data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1262\">Spelers:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1293\" data-is-only-node=\"\">1–2 spelers (split-screen)</strong><br data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1296\"><strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1309\">Conditie:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1328\">In Nette Staat</strong><br data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1331\"><strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1345\">Inclusief:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1366\">Origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1402\"><strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1402\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand</strong></p>",
